.RE

.TP
.B /dms/tokenomics/contract/list_incoming
List incoming contracts.
.RS
Examples:
.B nunet actor cmd --context user /dms/tokenomics/contract/list_incoming
.RE

.TP
.B /dms/tokenomics/contract/transactions/list
List contract transactions.
.RS
Examples:
.B nunet actor cmd --context user /dms/tokenomics/contract/transactions/list
.RE

.TP
.B /dms/tokenomics/contract/transactions/confirm
Confirm a contract transaction.
.RS
