\fB--contract-did\fR \fISTRING\fR (required)
\fB--contract-host-did\fR \fISTRING\fR (optional)
Examples:
.B nunet actor cmd --context user /dms/tokenomics/contract/complete --contract-did <did> --contract-host-did <hostdid>
